    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention: A microphone connected to your PC and a \u2606magical girl\u2606 mindset are required to play this game. <br>For the best experience, it is recommended to connect the microphone directly to the PC without using any additional devices or effects for best experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u301c(\uffe3\u25b3\uffe3\u301c) The long-awaited Episode 2 update!! (\u301c\uffe3\u25b3\uffe3)\u301c</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0b18(\u0a6d\u02ca\u1d55\u02cb)\u0a6d* \u0a48\u2729\u2027\u208a\u02da Experience Bujang Kim's new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters with new characters, and new ways to magically battle evil! \u0d26\u0d4d\u0d26\u0d3f \u02c3 \u1d17 \u02c2 )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Magical Mic Duel: Senpai, Hear My Spell, you become a magical girl and engage in magical battles. Just chant the spells displayed on the screen! Your voice spells will be analyzed by cutting-edge technology and cast as elegant and beautiful magic. The world needs your magic right now, for world peace! \u0b18(\u0a6d\u02ca\u1d55\u02cb)\u0a6d* \u0a48\u2729\u2027\u208a\u02da</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\t2024 Seoul, where the declining birth rate has led to a shortage of magical girls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tLife is tough due to severe conflicts! \u0b18(,\u00b4 o`)\u0b13 What we need is a magical girl \u0d26\u0d4d\u0d26\u0d3f\u02ca\u15dc\u02cb)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\t\u2049\ufe0f Do you also have a burning desire to protect your loved ones!? \u2727\u207a\u2e1c(\uff65 \u15dc \uff65 )\u2e1d\u207a\u2727</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tThen become the middle-aged male magical girl you've always imagined and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665    Magically Duel with friends or foes over the network or on the same computer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tExcessive immersion can bring positive energy to the lives of those around you. (\u02f5 \u2022\u0300 \u1d17 - \u02f5 ) \u2727</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casting Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696400/extras/96b24cc8aef53d8e948871f3270f454c.poster.avif?t=1749454979\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696400/extras/96b24cc8aef53d8e948871f3270f454c.webm?t=1749454979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696400/extras/96b24cc8aef53d8e948871f3270f454c.mp4?t=1749454979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696400/extras/329e059913b53294934da6ac68a5879b.poster.avif?t=1749454979\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696400/extras/329e059913b53294934da6ac68a5879b.webm?t=1749454979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696400/extras/329e059913b53294934da6ac68a5879b.mp4?t=1749454979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tSimply chant various spells with \u2606all your heart\u2606 to cast them. \u0b18(\u0a6d\u02c3\u1d17\u02c2)\u2501\u2606\uff9f.*\uff65\uff61\uff9f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tStrong magic comes from a strong heart. The more sincerity you put in, the more powerful attacks you can unleash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665 Try to \u266cattack your opponents in various ways\u266c, such as with high notes\u266c, loud voices, \u2727 special rhythms and more! (Episode 2 update!)\u2727 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tAll you need to prepare is a strong will, a loud voice, and the heart of a magical girl. (\u02f5 \u2022\u0300 \u1d17 - \u02f5 ) \u2727</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696400/extras/94eaafc6fbf38bcb27358edde6f4aeda.poster.avif?t=1749454979\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696400/extras/94eaafc6fbf38bcb27358edde6f4aeda.webm?t=1749454979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696400/extras/94eaafc6fbf38bcb27358edde6f4aeda.mp4?t=1749454979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tSet in modern Seoul, which is suffering from a shortage of magical girls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tBuckle up for a dazzling cast of characters, each with a personality as quirky as their magical attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tYour seemingly ordinary boss might secretly wish for frilly outfits and a magic wand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tA series of events that could happen to you right now, the best solution to solve problems is the lovely magic of a magical girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\tFollow the story and make a firm commitment to live as a magical girl in the world, both day and night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is not affiliated with any real-life organizations or individuals and is for entertainment purposes only.</p>",
