    "short_description": "\u0b18(\u0a6d\u02ca\u1d55\u02cb)\u0a6d* \u0a48\u2729\u2027\u208a\u02da Embrace your destiny in Magical Mic Duel: Senpai, Hear My Spell! Your voice commands the forces of fabulousness. Chant spells with conviction, and witness dazzling displays of magical might! The world needs your power. Step up and claim your place as the ultimate magical girl!",
